    "Report F1, EM, evidence recall, actual payload, full provider input/output usage and actual recipient call counts. Report each optimizer seed and seed-averaged question-paired contrasts, including learned versus matched random, with uncertainty and exploratory Holm correction. Never count 300×3 as 900 independent questions.\n",
    "\n",
